---
layout: shell.njk
title: 标签
permalink: /tags/
navKey: tags
---
<div class="page-shell">
  <header class="page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">// TOPICS</p>
    <h1>全部主题 <span lang="en">Browse by topic</span></h1>
    <p>从 Agent 架构、工具链与工程实践进入文章。</p>
  </header>

  {% if blog.tags.length %}
  <ul class="topic-grid topic-grid--page">
    {% for group in blog.tags %}
    <li>
      <a href="/tags/{{ group.tag | tagPath | urlencode }}/">
        <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span><strong>{{ group.tag }}</strong><small>Topic {{ loop.index }}</small></span>
        <b>{{ group.posts.length }}</b>
      </a>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% else %}
  <p class="empty">还没有主题。</p>
  {% endif %}
</div>
